# date: 2026-09-12
# RTL: v1.0 (f07ddca) + CDC-10 fix: flag outputs of gals_noc_top and done/err of
#      traffic_node_agent registered in their source domain before the synchronisers
# MARK_DEBUG 1104 nets -> 5 ILA cores / 55 probes / 1100 bits; WNS +0.974 ns
#
# report_cdc (now run by hw_scripts/batch_impl.tcl on the routed design):
#   before: CDC-3 129, CDC-6 36, CDC-9 2, CDC-10 Critical 5, CDC-15 338
#   after : CDC-3 134, CDC-6 36, CDC-9 2, CDC-10 Critical 0, CDC-15 338
#   the five criticals were |ecc_dbe, |tid_err_node (gals_noc_top -> LED synchroniser) and
#   test_done && !stuck_seen in the three sender agents (-> noc_stress_tester synchroniser):
#   combinational logic feeding sync_2stage directly. CDC-6 = gray pointers, CDC-15 = FIFO RAM
#   read ports + ILA internals, CDC-9 = reset synchronisers; all expected.
#
# setup_debug.tcl now reports dest_err_node[3:0] as CONSTANT (LUT1 of GND): the stress agents'
# tdest is a parameter, so synthesis folds the whole dest_err path away. dest_err 0 below is
# structural, not evidence.

